en.description:
`enrollments.score` is NULL when a student enrolled but missed the exam; a score of 0 is a real result. For each course with at least one enrollment, report the number enrolled, the number who sat the exam, the average score of those who sat (NULL if nobody did), and the average counting absences as 0. Round both averages with `ROUND(x, 2)`.

Tables in the database (SQLite):

```sql
CREATE TABLE courses (
  id INTEGER PRIMARY KEY,
  title TEXT NOT NULL
);
CREATE TABLE enrollments (
  student_id INTEGER NOT NULL,
  course_id INTEGER NOT NULL,
  score INTEGER            -- NULL: did not sit the exam
);
```

problem.description:
`enrollments.score` 为 NULL 表示学生选了课但缺考，0 分是真实成绩。对每门至少有一人选课的课程，求：选课人数、参加考试人数、参加考试者的平均分（没人参加时为 NULL），以及把缺考按 0 分计的平均分。两个平均分都用 `ROUND(x, 2)` 保留两位小数。

数据库中的表（SQLite）：

```sql
CREATE TABLE courses (
  id INTEGER PRIMARY KEY,
  title TEXT NOT NULL
);
CREATE TABLE enrollments (
  student_id INTEGER NOT NULL,
  course_id INTEGER NOT NULL,
  score INTEGER            -- NULL: did not sit the exam
);
```

